 R←Test_SendEmail_51(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;cp;connection;rc;msg;log
⍝ Without a password there is no authentication, as for a relay in an internal network
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 ∆SERVER.Clear
 ∆SERVER.AuthMethods←''
 cp←∆NewParms
 cp.Password←''
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂cp)
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send ∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf 1=≢∆SERVER.Messages
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢∆SERVER.Logons
 →T.PassesIf~∨/'AUTH'∘≡¨4↑¨∆SERVER.Commands

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
